sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as AI Gateway<br/>Envoy Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ExtProc as Payload Processing<br/>ext-proc Server<br/>9004/TCP gRPC
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Provider as External LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    note over Client,Provider: Flow 1: Inference Request Processing

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / API Key
    Gateway->>ExtProc: ext_proc callout<br/>gRPC mTLS (Istio) or self-signed TLS
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Resolve ExternalModel + ExternalProvider<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: Model/Provider config + Secret
    note right of ExtProc: Plugin pipeline executes:<br/>1. model-provider-resolver<br/>2. API format translation<br/>3. apikey-injection<br/>4. NeMo guardrails (optional)<br/>5. metering (optional)
    ExtProc-->>Gateway: ProcessingResponse + DynamicMetadata<br/>gRPC mTLS
    Gateway->>Provider: Translated request<br/>HTTPS TLS (DestinationRule SIMPLE)<br/>Auth: API key / SigV4 / OAuth2
    Provider-->>Gateway: LLM response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON response

    note over ExtProc,K8sAPI: Flow 2: ExternalProvider Reconciliation

    note right of ExtProc: ExternalProvider CR created/updated
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create ExternalName Service<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceEntry (DNS resolution)<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create DestinationRule (TLS origination)<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount

    note over ExtProc,K8sAPI: Flow 3: ExternalModel Reconciliation

    note right of ExtProc: ExternalModel CR created/updated
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Get ExternalProvider<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount
